# =============================================================================
# Project NEXUS — Public Repository .gitignore
# =============================================================================
# Only essential platform files are tracked. Everything else is excluded.
# =============================================================================

# ─── Dependencies ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/node_modules
/.next/
/vendor
composer.phar

# ─── Environment & Credentials (NEVER commit) ────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.docker.example
!.env.example
# Narrow exception: the Web UK Docker defaults file. web-uk/compose.yml lists it
# under `env_file:`, so both of its services refuse to start without it — a
# clean clone could not run `docker compose up` at all while `.env.*` above was
# swallowing it. It holds no credentials: a port, a backend URL, and two
# obviously-labelled local dev placeholder secrets. Real secrets still belong in
# an untracked .env, which the rules above continue to catch.
# (aspnet-backend/.env.docker is the equivalent file for the ASP.NET stack; it
# is re-included by aspnet-backend/.gitignore, which takes precedence there.)
!web-uk/.env.docker
/env
/env.docker
/env.testing
.cloudflare-api-token
.build-version

# ─── Local documentation archive (private cleanup history) ───────────────────
/.local-docs-archive/

# ─── Docs site (MkDocs) build artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────
/site/
/docs/openapi.json

# ─── AI Assistant Config (contains sensitive project context) ─────────────────
CLAUDE.md
# Per-track agent guides. These are the working instructions for the two
# imported tracks, not machine-local notes, and the blanket rule above was
# quietly excluding them: web-uk/CLAUDE.md (32 KB, the largest single piece of
# Web UK guidance) survived only as an untracked file that one `git clean`
# would have destroyed, and aspnet-backend/CLAUDE.md was lost entirely in the
# 2026-08-09 move and had to be re-imported from the archive repository.
!web-uk/CLAUDE.md
!aspnet-backend/CLAUDE.md
.agent/
.claude/

# ─── All Markdown in root except licensing files ──────────────────────────────
/*.md
!README.md
